    "canonical_ref": "TheophCaes.1.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "[a.d. 180.] When Eusebius says that the churches of “all Asia” concurred in the Ephesine use concerning the Paschal, he evidently means Asia Minor, as in the Scriptures and elsewhere.",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
