    "work_id": "anf-works/theophilus-of-caesarea-fragment",
    "canonical_ref": "TheophCaes.1.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "with Cassius of Tyre and Clarus of Ptolemais, which confirmed it. It is to be noted, that Alexandria is cited by Theophilus as authority for this custom;",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 195,
    "date_range": [
